#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:175
msgid ""
"A ``Content-Length`` is re-emitted. A chunked body that ended within the "
"connection buffer is decoded in place and sent with its length. A longer "
"one is announced as ``Transfer-Encoding: chunked`` and re-chunked one "
"read at a time (SID 0009): each read lands in the proxy's 16 KiB upload "
"buffer, is decoded in place there, and goes out as one canonical chunk, "
"so the origin never sees the client's chunk sizes, extensions or "
"trailers. The audit set:"
msgstr ""
"``Content-Length``\\ "
"は出力し直します。接続バッファーの中で終わるチャンク形式のボディーは、その場でデコードし、長さを付けて送ります。それより長いものは\\ "
"``Transfer-Encoding: chunked``\\ と告げ、一回の読み込みごとにチャンク化し直します（SID "
"0009）。各読み込みはプロキシの16 "
"KiBのアップロードバッファーに入り、そこでその場でデコードされ、正規の一つのチャンクとして送り出されます。そのため、オリジンがクライアントのチャンクサイズ、拡張、トレーラーを見ることはありません。監査用のフィールドの組は次のとおりです。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:177
msgid ""
"Connection: keep-alive\n"
"X-Forwarded-For: <client>\n"
"X-Forwarded-Proto: <scheme>\n"
"X-Real-IP: <client>\n"
"X-Sibuna-Status: PASS\n"
"X-Sibuna-Rule: session | robots-txt | ip/cidr-trie | ..."
msgstr ""
"Connection: keep-alive\n"
"X-Forwarded-For: <client>\n"
"X-Forwarded-Proto: <scheme>\n"
"X-Real-IP: <client>\n"
"X-Sibuna-Status: PASS\n"
"X-Sibuna-Rule: session | robots-txt | ip/cidr-trie | ..."

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:186
msgid ""
"Bodies larger than the buffer are relayed in 16 KiB pieces from the "
"client to the origin writer (``relay_body``) before the response is "
"streamed back. The unit test "
"``proxy_head_rewrite_drops_hop_by_hop_headers_and_injects_audit_fields`` "
"in ``crates/net/src/request.rs`` asserts that the rewrite drops a spoofed "
"``X-Forwarded-For`` and injects the audit fields."
msgstr ""
"バッファーより大きいボディーは、応答をストリームで返す前に、クライアントからオリジン向けのライターへ16 KiBずつ中継します（\\ "
"``relay_body``\\ ）。\\ ``crates/net/src/request.rs``\\ の単体テスト\\ "
"``proxy_head_rewrite_drops_hop_by_hop_headers_and_injects_audit_fields``\\ "
"は、書き換えが偽装された\\ ``X-Forwarded-For``\\ を取り除き、監査用のフィールドを挿入することを確認します。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:188
msgid ""
"The proxy's three buffers, the origin read buffer (one response head, 16 "
"KiB), the origin write buffer (8 KiB) and the upload buffer (16 KiB), "
"live in a ``Workspace`` that the connection allocates once and reuses for "
"every request. The workspace makes their lifetime the connection's, not "
"the exchange's, and the origin reader and writer borrow them for one "
"exchange at a time."
msgstr ""
"プロキシの三つのバッファー、つまりオリジンの読み込みバッファー（応答のヘッダー部一つ、16 KiB）、オリジンの書き込みバッファー（8 "
"KiB）、アップロードバッファー（16 KiB）は、接続が一度だけ確保してすべてのリクエストで再利用する\\ ``Workspace``\\ "
"にあります。作業領域によって、それらの寿命は一回のやり取りではなく接続の寿命になり、オリジンのリーダーとライターは一回のやり取りの間だけそれらを借用します。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:190
msgid "Relaying the Origin Response"
msgstr "オリジンの応答の中継"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:193
msgid ""
"The first proxy streamed the origin's bytes until the origin closed and "
"then closed the client: correct framing with no parsing, at the price of "
"a new TCP connection per proxied request. Under a load generator that "
"price was visible as tens of thousands of sockets in ``TIME_WAIT`` and, "
"on loopback, exhausted ephemeral ports. The proxy now reads the origin's "
"head (at most 16 KiB) and classifies the body by RFC 9112's rules:"
msgstr ""
"最初のプロキシは、オリジンが閉じるまでオリジンのバイトをストリームし、その後クライアントを閉じていました。パースなしで正しくフレーミングできますが、プロキシするリクエストごとに新しいTCP接続が必要になります。負荷生成器の下では、その代償が\\ "
"``TIME_WAIT``\\ "
"にある何万ものソケットとして現れ、ループバックではエフェメラルポートを使い果たしました。現在のプロキシはオリジンのヘッダー部（最大16 "
"KiB）を読み、RFC 9112の規則でボディーを分類します。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:195
msgid "Implementation: ``parse_response_head``"
msgstr "実装：\\ ``parse_response_head``"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:197
msgid ""
"Returns the status, one of four framings (no body for HEAD, 1xx, 204 and "
"304; a ``Content-Length``; chunked transfer coding; or close-delimited) "
"and whether the origin keeps the connection. In "
"``crates/net/src/response.rs`` (crate ``sibuna-net``)."
msgstr ""
"ステータス、四つのフレーミングのいずれか（HEAD、1xx、204、304ではボディーなし。\\ ``Content-Length``\\ "
"。chunked転送コーディング。接続の切断で区切るもの）、オリジンが接続を維持するかどうかを返します。\\ "
"``crates/net/src/response.rs``\\ （クレート\\ ``sibuna-net``\\ ）にあります。"

#: ../../zero-allocation.rst:199
msgid ""
"pub enum Framing { None, Length(u64), Chunked, UntilClose }\n"
"\n"
"pub fn parse_response_head(\n"
"    head: &[u8],\n"
"    head_request: bool,\n"
") -> Option<ResponseHead> {\n"
"    let status = status_code(head)?;\n"
"    let mut fields = FramingFields {\n"
"        keep_alive: head.get(7) == Some(&b'1'),\n"
"        ..Default::default()\n"
"    };\n"
"    for line in crlf_lines(head).skip(1) {\n"
"        if line.is_empty() {\n"
"            break;\n"
"        }\n"
"        fields.read_line(line)?; // Transfer-Encoding, Content-Length, "
"Connection\n"
"    }\n"
"    let mut framing = fields.length.map_or(Framing::UntilClose, "
"Framing::Length);\n"
"    if head_request || status / 100 == 1 || status == 204 || status == 304 "
"{\n"
"        framing = Framing::None;\n"
"    } else if fields.encoded {\n"
"        framing =\n"
"            if fields.chunked { Framing::Chunked } else { "
"Framing::UntilClose };\n"
"    }\n"
"    let mut keep_alive = fields.keep_alive;\n"
"    if framing == Framing::UntilClose || fields.closing {\n"
"        keep_alive = false;\n"
"    }\n"
"    if fields.nominates_framing {\n"
"        return None;\n"
"    }\n"
"    Some(ResponseHead { status, framing, keep_alive })\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
